@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix semts: <https://w3id.org/semts/ontology#>.

_:Bc0ff4f0fa89d84d1db960f20090b2573 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AllDisjointClasses>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#members> (semts:KnowledgeComparisonMeasure
                                                                             semts:KnowledgeGenerationMethod
                                                                             semts:KnowledgeReasoning).
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
