<http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt#Datatype> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt#Unit> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
